## Process Concepts

ps      = View processes
top     = Live process monitoring
pgrep   = Find process ID
kill    = Send signal to process
PID     = Process ID
PPID    = Parent Process ID
jobs    = Shell jobs
fg      = Background → Foreground
bg      = Stopped → Background

## Key Learning

Every running program in Linux is a process.

Parent Process
      ↓
    PPID
      ↓
   Process
      ↓
     PID

Process management is a core skill for Linux Administration, Infrastructure Support, Cloud and DevOps.

